ilist","id":"100979","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35720","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69225","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319983","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"76151","synopsis":"いつものようにバーで飲んでいるジーンとニーノ。酔いが回ってきた頃、ニーノはジュモーク区でジーンに言われた言葉について問い掛ける。\n\n「そういえば、お前だっていないだろ？ 友達」「？……何の話？」","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u7nKdTfOFcnhFr2Ois1LZ1cYX3j.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anilist","id":"100979","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35720","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69225","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319983","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"76152","synopsis":"ある日の本部長室。そこにはとある噂を耳にし緊張を漲らせるモーヴの姿があった。「ついに来た。あの男が動く時が」。一方ドーワーでは、シュヴァーン王子が不測の事態に眉を潜めていた。「──質問に答えろ。ボクがいつ『トースト尽くしにしろ』って頼んだのか聞いている」","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/luqvlxvhFy37dYgnnDjAQIlhcLK.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anilist","id":"100979","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35720","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69225","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319983","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"76153","synopsis":"談話室でお茶を愉しむリーリウム長官とパイン長官 は、先の5長官会議でのグロッシュラー長官の発言について議論していた。「おそらく偶然だろう。彼には少し浮世離れした一面がある 」「確かにそうだ……。だが、その後の事も考えるとどうだ？」","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m7jdmWEbS9IrRur7qjEcvsNkeuv.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anilist","id":"100979","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35720","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69225","scope":"s0","seasonNumber